---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Read the terms and conditions for using Viona's AI-powered video editing platform."
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 lg:pt-40">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight mb-6">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground">
          Last updated: March 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Welcome to Viona. These Terms of Service govern your access to and use of the Viona
            platform, including our website, applications, and AI-powered video editing services.
            By creating an account or using our services, you agree to be bound by these terms.
            If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Service Description</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Viona is an AI-powered video editing platform that transforms talking-head videos into
            visually-rich content. Our services include automatic transcription with word-level
            accuracy, AI-generated contextual visuals such as charts, diagrams, and flowcharts,
            customizable subtitle styling, filler word removal, and video export in multiple
            formats and resolutions. We continuously improve and update our platform, and features
            may be added, modified, or removed at our discretion. We will make reasonable efforts
            to notify users of significant changes that affect their workflow.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">User Accounts</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            To access most features of Viona, you must create an account by providing accurate
            and complete information. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of
            your account credentials and for all activities that occur under your account. You
            must notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account. We reserve the
            right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms or that we reasonably
            believe have been compromised. You must be at least 16 years old to create an account
            and use our services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Acceptable Use</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4">
            You agree to use Viona only for lawful purposes and in accordance with these terms.
            You may not:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed space-y-2">
            <li>Upload content that infringes on the intellectual property rights of others</li>
            <li>Upload or generate content that is illegal, harmful, threatening, abusive, defamatory, or otherwise objectionable</li>
            <li>Attempt to reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble any part of our platform</li>
            <li>Use automated scripts or bots to access our services without prior written consent</li>
            <li>Interfere with or disrupt the integrity or performance of our platform</li>
            <li>Resell, redistribute, or sublicense access to Viona without our authorization</li>
            <li>Use the service to generate misleading or deceptive content, including deepfakes intended to deceive</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-4">
            We reserve the right to remove content and suspend accounts that violate these
            guidelines without prior notice.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            You retain full ownership of the video content you upload to Viona and the finished
            videos you export from our platform. By uploading content, you grant us a limited,
            non-exclusive license to process, store, and transform your content solely for the
            purpose of providing our services to you. The Viona platform itself, including our
            AI models, algorithms, software, branding, templates, and generated visual assets,
            remains the intellectual property of Viona. You may use AI-generated visuals within
            your exported videos for any commercial or personal purpose, but you may not extract,
            redistribute, or resell the visual assets independently outside of your video content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            Viona is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis. We make no warranties,
            express or implied, regarding the reliability, accuracy, or availability of our
            services. To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Viona shall not be
            liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages
            arising from your use of or inability to use our services. This includes, but is
            not limited to, loss of data, loss of revenue, or interruption of business. Our
            total liability for any claims arising under these terms shall not exceed the amount
            you have paid to us in the twelve months preceding the claim. Nothing in these terms
            excludes or limits liability that cannot be lawfully excluded or limited.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Termination</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            You may terminate your account at any time by contacting us or through your account
            settings. Upon termination, your right to use the service will cease immediately. We
            will delete your account data and video content within 30 days of termination, unless
            we are required to retain it for legal reasons. We may also terminate or suspend your
            access to our services at any time, with or without cause, if we determine that you
            have violated these terms. If we terminate your account due to a violation, you will
            not be entitled to a refund of any prepaid fees. We may also discontinue the service
            entirely with 30 days notice to active users.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Changes to Terms</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. When we make
            material changes, we will update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page
            and notify you via email or through a prominent notice on our platform. Your continued
            use of Viona after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised terms.
            If you do not agree to the updated terms, you should stop using our services and
            close your account.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Governing Law</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            These Terms of Service shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws
            of the jurisdiction in which Viona operates, without regard to conflict of law principles.
            Any disputes arising from or relating to these terms or your use of our services shall
            be resolved through binding arbitration in accordance with applicable arbitration rules,
            unless you are located in a jurisdiction where arbitration agreements are not enforceable,
            in which case the courts of competent jurisdiction shall have exclusive authority.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
            If you have any questions about these Terms of Service or need to report a violation,
            please contact us at
            <a href="mailto:hello@viona.app" class="text-primary hover:underline">hello@viona.app</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
